cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "PoIA — Proof-of-Intent Authorization: research artifact"
abstract: >-
  Relying-party prototype, symbolic models, evaluation harness and recorded
  measurements for Proof-of-Intent Authorization (PoIA), an authorization
  contract requiring a fresh single-use proof over a canonical intent,
  normalized execution correspondence, referent version-and-digest agreement
  atomic with the protected effect, and k-of-n independent commitment
  confinement before signing.
